      "en": "All these joined together in the valley of Siddim (also called the Salt Sea).",
      "ko": "이들이 다 싯딤 골짜기 곧 지금 염해에 모였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "5085a3f323c8c38ccde756059435451e1c4db5a8962ce558ae930225b7a0006d",
      "translation_text_hash": "22b70de599efbf658afd49508064527d716b33cf1e6e5544d8644273407b6346",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
