      "en": "The king of Sodom, and the king of Gomorrah, the king of Admah, the king of Zeboiim, and the king of Bela (also called Zoar) went out; and they set the battle in array against them in the valley of Siddim",
      "ko": "소돔왕과 고모라왕과 아드마왕과 스보임왕과 벨라 곧 소알왕이 나와서 싯딤 골짜기에서 그들과 접전하였으니",
      "source_text_hash": "83b2e84d00852d63c728b37d89374a23cc67d7787e46adf65f92ca6ed81d984b",
      "translation_text_hash": "c109390b86099c0a8a7e747897d0838594ccaff466aa6c002fdd2e8682a5b886",
