      "en": "Now the valley of Siddim was full of tar pits; and the kings of Sodom and Gomorrah fled, and some fell there. Those who remained fled to the hills.",
      "ko": "싯딤 골짜기에는 역청 구덩이가 많은지라 소돔왕과 고모라왕이 달아날 때에 군사가 거기 빠지고 그 나머지는 산으로 도망하매",
      "source_text_hash": "c8ce43b83657faa8d26c73f60caab6e16d891e4eab6510da97e47331d1cf4f3c",
      "translation_text_hash": "0976e30f52d5a1bdcaf636f31cd5af44075ff8900b7a52580af491cb435235ed",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
